  "title": "Frontier Launches Nonstop Service From Nashville International Airport to Las Vegas",
  "summary": "NASHVILLE – June 11, 2026 – Frontier Airlines (Nasdaq: ULCC) launched nonstop service today from Nashville International Airport (BNA) to Harry Reid International Airport in Las Vegas (LAS), operating four times per week. With the new route, the airline now serves five destinations nonstop from BNA and, to celebrate, is offering fares as low...",
